WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Out of noise, a rule that anyone can verify.

2
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:23.400 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
15 March 2026 · 18:00 UTC — the genesis block
An independent Layer 1 blockchain. No premine, no ICO.

3
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:30.600 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Every block links to the one before it, back to genesis.

4
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.600 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
ConvergenceX — a memory-hard, sequential proof of work
100,000 rounds per attempt · 4 GB dataset · 4 GB scratchpad

5
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.800 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
A reference miner built for ordinary CPUs.
Consensus does not enforce CPU-only mining.

6
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.800 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Every node re-checks every block.
Verification needs only a few megabytes.

7
00:00:53.400 --> 00:01:00.200 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
V16 — active since block #25,000
Each block pays 50 % to its miner and 50 % to the DTD.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.400 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
DTD: one winner per block, drawn among recent miners.
DTD Jackpot: every 288 blocks, paid from the frozen consensus reserve.

9
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.600 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Today the chain is near block #36,000 (November 2026).
Block #40,000 is the planned point for the V17 upgrade.

10
00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:23.000 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
V17 proposes 80 % to PoW miners, 10 % to the DTD,
5 % to the Jackpot and 5 % to Useful Compute. Proposed — not active.

11
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:29.800 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Useful Compute: 5 % of each block held in a native vault with no private key,
to reward scientific and industrial computation that clients actually need.

12
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:36.400 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Rewards only after independent verification — never twice for the same task.
Proposed for V17: verification and payout rules are still being designed.

13
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:44.400 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Self-custodial web wallet · public Explorer · open-source nodes
Interfaces as shown on sostcore.com in November 2026.

14
00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:55.000 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Universal Assets — registering and verifying real-world assets
In development and not active on mainnet. Tokenization is a later phase. Illustrative concept.

15
00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:02.400 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
Block #40,000 — a planned milestone
V17 is a proposed upgrade in testing. It is not active and no release has been published.

16
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:08.400 line:91%,end align:center size:90%
wSOST on Ethereum — planned, not deployed
No wSOST contract and no bridge are in operation.
